# AI Provider Configuration (Optional)
# If no key is set, the portfolio uses a built-in intelligent human fallback engine.
# Set any of the following keys to enable direct LLM-powered responses:

# Google Gemini API (Recommended: free tier available at https://aistudio.google.com/)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
